<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cenbank offers to add CZK 8 bln in o/n repo.</title>
<headline>Czech cenbank offers to add CZK 8 bln in o/n repo.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank offered to add eight billion crowns to the money market on Friday through an overnight repo tender, the bank said.</p>
<p>No limit yield was announced for the tender. The Prague Interbank offered rate stood at 194.3 percent on Thursday up from 172.1 percent on Wednesday, as the market remained illiquid amid the central bank's efforts to support the Czech crown.</p>
<p>-- John Mastrini, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
